# W44-205 Phase 1 + Phase 3 Validation Bench Metadata

date: 2026-05-22
parent_commit: db83b5a0 (main@origin — W44-203 OOM falsification)
chunk: W44-205 (extension of W44-201 to coeff_orders medium buckets 2+4)
