## Reproduce

```bash
cd ~/work/zen/jxl-encoder
cargo run -p jxl-encoder --release \
  --features '__expert __internal_recon_hook butteraugli-loop ssim2-loop parallel' \
  --example w44_205_bucket_probe
cargo run -p jxl-encoder --release \
  --features '__expert __internal_recon_hook butteraugli-loop ssim2-loop parallel' \
  --example w44_205_production_ab
```

